# Ignore list for Eagle, a PCB layout tool

# Backup files
*.s#?
*.b#?
*.l#?

# Eagle project file
# It contains a serial number and references to the file structure
# on your computer.
# comment the following line if you want to have your project file included.
eagle.epf

# CAM files
*.$$$
*.cmp
*.ly2
*.l15
*.sol
*.plc
*.stc
*.sts
*.crc
*.crs

*.dri
*.drl
*.gpi
*.pls

*.drd
*.drd.*

*.info

*.eps


# PlatformIO
.pio/

# Oven-specific and personal: run captures, measured behaviour, handover notes.
# Kept on disk, deliberately never tracked -- purged from history 2026-09-04.
logs/
REWORK_NOTES.md
HARDWARE_CHECKS.md
PORTING_ANALYSIS.md

# Screenshots of the oven UI. The browser address bar in one carries the LAN
# address, which is the same thing the history purge existed to remove.
Screenshot*.png
screenshot*.png
